---
import Icon from "../design-system/Icon.astro";
---

{/* What this device holds of a card's item, after its facts: heard to the end, saved for offline.
     Both are hidden until the card says so (library.css, on data-played and data-downloaded), so a
     mark takes room only while it is shown. The facts never change; the marks come after them, as one
     group, so a narrow card moves both to a line of their own and never splits them. */}
<span class="card-marks">
  <span class="card-mark card-played"><Icon name="checkCircle" /><span class="sr-only">Played</span></span>
  <span class="card-mark card-downloaded"><Icon name="download" /><span class="sr-only">Downloaded</span></span>
</span>
